                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "First off, the developer is freaking awesome! The humor of this game caught my attention right away, and at 3 bucks, I thought \"why not?\". I began playing and had a problem right from the start. Nothing wrong with the game, but rather my preferences. I play most FPS/flying games with an inverted mouse. The option was not available in the options menu in the game. So I did like I do with most games that have this same issue. I posted in the forums to see if there was a way to invert my mouse so I don't crash into things like a drunk spermy driver. Within hours the dev replied to my post and only a short time after replying, UPDATED THE ENTIRE GAME just to add an invert mouse option! I've never even seen anything like this before. So, in my opinion, this game is worth buying - and any other game this dev puts out in the future. \n\nAlso, I love this game lol! Such a simple and unique idea (a common factor in many hit games) and so much fun with lasers, torpedoes and fierce battles with 1000 spermies at a time. \n\n10/10 Replay value: Would ejaculate again and again and again and again etc.",
